            "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
            "body": "I don't have time to work on the fix, but I imagine it'll involve extending https://github.com/cython/cython/blob/a76568d4e9cce24843e5b9e41f67e4dd5d8a6773/Cython/Coverage.py#L138C59-L138C79 to also look into the [`exclude_also`](https://coverage.readthedocs.io/en/7.16.2/config.html#report-exclude-also) setting in addition to [`exclude_lines`](https://coverage.readthedocs.io/en/7.16.2/config.html#report-exclude-lines).\n\nInternally, this list is appended: https://github.com/coveragepy/coveragepy/blob/108b518ec87257f9a17bad861dc1bd6a91433768/coverage/config.py#L568. But that's probably not exposed as a public API so it likely has to be duplicated.",
